37","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":20,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"  * When suggesting a Git command, briefly explain what it does.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-04T15:44:37","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":21,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"  * Add explanatory Javadoc comments to all classes and to nontrivial methods and fields when their purpose or behavior is not obvious.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-04T15:44:37","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":22,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"  * Make generated code as self-explanatory as possible, and include explanatory comments where they improve understanding.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-04T15:44:37","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":23,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"  * When faced with a design choice, choose the simplest option that is sufficient for the requirements, while briefly explaining relevant more advanced alternatives.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-04T15:44:37","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":24,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-04T15:44:37","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":25,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"# Project-specific requirements","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-04T15:44:37","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":26,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-04T15:44:37","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":27,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"## Java version:","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-04T15:44:37","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":28,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-04T15:44:37","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":29,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"Ensure that Java 25 is used when running the application or build tasks. On macOS, use `sdk use java 25.0.3.fx-zulu` to switch to Java 25 if needed.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-04T15:44:37","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":30,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-04T15:44:37","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":3